  "description": "Automatic TLS certificates for Shiny.Net.HttpServer from Let's Encrypt, ZeroSSL or any ACME (RFC 8555) CA — issued, stored, renewed and hot-swapped into the running server, with HTTP-01 and TLS-ALPN-01 answered by the server itself. Built on in-box cryptography only: no BouncyCastle, no Certes, and trim- and AOT-clean.",
